# Accumulation outputs are large and fully regenerable (rebuild via
#   uv run python -m bac_metadata.bac_agentic_metadata.engine.cli.accumulate ...).
# Only curated_escalations.tsv is kept under version control — it is the precious,
# non-regenerable human curator input (answered/skipped escalation decisions).
*
!.gitignore
!curated_escalations.tsv
